### ==================== 跨产业链父节点校验 ====================

### 9.1 创建临时产业链 B（用于跨产业链父节点校验测试）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chains
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chainName": "跨产业链校验临时链-请删除",
  "description": "chain.http 跨产业链测试用，测完即删"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tempChainId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 9.2 在产业链 B 下创建子节点，parentId 使用产业链 A 的 n1（应返回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chains/{{tempChainId}}/nodes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentId": {{n1}},
  "nodeName": "跨产业链子节点"
}

> {%
    client.test("跨产业链父节点应返回 400", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 400);
        client.assert(response.body.code === 400);
        client.assert(response.body.message === "父节点不属于当前产业链");
    });
%}

### 9.3 清理临时产业链 B
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chains/{{tempChainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

