DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chains/nodes/{{n1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. 删除 n4（n2 已删，n4 变叶子，200）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chains/nodes/{{n4}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27. 删除产业链（200；固定阶段节点随产业链逻辑删除）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/chains/{{chainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. 确认清理干净：查 chainId 应返回 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chains/{{chainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 29. 记录本次测试结束时间（用于清理 operation_log）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

> {%
    function pad(value) {
        return value.toString().padStart(2, "0");
    }
    const now = new Date();
    const localDateTime =
        now.getFullYear() + "-" +
        pad(now.getMonth() + 1) + "-" +
        pad(now.getDate()) + "T" +
        pad(now.getHours()) + ":" +
        pad(now.getMinutes()) + ":" +
        pad(now.getSeconds());
    client.global.set("chainHttpEndedAt", localDateTime);
%}

### 30. 清理本次 chain.http 测试产生的操作日志
### 注意：OperationLog 是异步落库，执行 29 后建议等待 2-3 秒再执行本请求。
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/operation-logs/maintenance/chain-http
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startedAt": "{{chainHttpStartedAt}}",
  "endedAt": "{{chainHttpEndedAt}}",
  "chainId": {{chainId}},
  "nodeIds": [
    {{n1}},
    {{n2}},
    {{n3}},
    {{n4}},
    {{siblingMoveA}},
    {{siblingMoveB}},
    {{tempChainId}},
    {{upstreamStageId}},
    {{midstreamStageId}},
    {{downstreamStageId}}
  ],
  "enterpriseIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}
